h h^{2,1}=0, and what structure explains their persistence?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0101"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:45f73e03d6e87b139fecca7c8022fbf31852be90f3b462bf3e7566a7bb677371","title":"What do first-year WMAP temperature and polarization observations imply about superhorizon initial fluctuations, single-field inflation, correlated CDM isocurvature, and possible features in the inflaton potential?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0103"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:45b70c8b85bc08df142065d96c6a0c26e712e137f7efbdebc64a37436afa07ae","title":"What information accounts for black hole entropy, and can the same quantum fluctuations explain both horizon entanglement and the gravitational coupling appearing in A/(4ħG), including its dependence on matter species?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0105"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:45aca9c0affa76f80a70de383f16df0dc9d074c16b018855364fb17488761d73","title":"How accurately do free bosonic and Nambu–Goto effective strings describe confining SU(2) Polyakov-loop correlations at low and intermediate temperatures, and do comparisons with SU(3) and Ising gauge theories suggest universality beyond the free-string limit?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0105"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:45d705732a45d913797d79e6fdfe08a0707b0775fb1498fd282c22a8095eeb39","title":"How do asymmetric rotations act on D-branes and implement asymmetric orbifold symmetries in the open-string sector? Can this explain mixed boundary conditions, recover boundary noncommutativity, and construct tadpole-cancelled asymmetric type I vacua?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0107"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:45993c760a635fc9efac4e38bcfcf4e9a3